Data

The MIT License above applies to the code of this package (the .R and .sh files). It does not apply
to the data files in data/ and data/raw/. These remain subject to the terms of their original
providers (Actuaries Climate Index sponsors, NOAA, Macrobond, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis,
Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta, National Bureau of Economic Research), as described in the Data
Availability Statement of ReadMe.pdf.

The original ACI workbook and the Macrobond export are not redistributed. The processed series in
data/ derived from them remain subject to the providers' terms (see ReadMe.pdf, Section 2.4).
